<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/eng@/~cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "No finding, judgment, sentence or order of any Court made or passed or imposed before the date of commencement of this Act or during or at the conclusion of any prosecution or proceeding referred to in subsection (1) shall be reversed, altered or affected by any provision of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/eng@> .
