<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "referred to as the \"Code\", is amended in section 133—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/51/eng@> .
